{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "": {},
    "A moment worth noticing": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un momento digno de atención"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"值得留意的一刻"}}}},
    "Companion": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compañero"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"跑步伙伴"}}}},
    "Companion style": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Estilo del compañero"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"伙伴风格"}}}},
    "Here is what your companion understood.": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esto es lo que entendió tu compañero."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这是你的伙伴所理解的内容。"}}}},
    "Recommended plans": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Planes recomendados"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"推荐计划"}}}},
    "Set up my companion": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Configurar mi compañero"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设置跑步伙伴"}}}},
    "Spoken Updates": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Actualizaciones por voz"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"语音播报"}}}},
    "Tell us the real story. Your companion will turn it into a first session and a plan that fits.": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cuéntanos tu situación real. Tu compañero la convertirá en una primera sesión y un plan a tu medida."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"告诉我们你的真实情况。你的伙伴会据此制定适合你的首次训练和计划。"}}}},
    "Tell us where you are starting.": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cuéntanos desde dónde empiezas."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"告诉我们你目前的跑步状态。"}}}},
    "Update frequency controls how often your companion offers spoken nudges and live pace, time, and distance recaps during an activity.": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La frecuencia de actualización controla cada cuánto tu compañero ofrece indicaciones por voz y resúmenes en vivo del ritmo, el tiempo y la distancia durante una actividad."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"播报频率决定跑步伙伴在训练中提供语音提示，以及播报配速、时间和距离的频率。"}}}},
    "Voice, style, and spoken update frequency": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voz, estilo y frecuencia de actualizaciones por voz"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"语音、风格和播报频率"}}}},
    "What should we focus on this week?": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿En qué deberíamos centrarnos esta semana?"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本周重点是什么？"}}}},
    "What should your running companion help you do first?": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿Qué debería ayudarte a hacer primero tu compañero de running?"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你希望跑步伙伴先帮助你做什么？"}}}},
    "Your companion": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tu compañero"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的跑步伙伴"}}}},
    "Your companion recommends one concrete session you can begin right away.": {"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tu compañero te recomienda una sesión concreta que puedes empezar de inmediato."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的伙伴会推荐一项可以立即开始的具体训练。"}}}},
    "“%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“You don’t need a perfect run. You need a beginning.”": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«No necesitas una carrera perfecta. Necesitas empezar.»"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“你不需要一次完美的跑步，你只需要迈出第一步。”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
