    "Tell your companion the real story. We will turn it into a first session and a plan that fits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuéntale a tu compañero tu situación real. La convertiremos en una primera sesión y un plan que encaje."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告诉跑步伙伴你的真实情况。我们会据此制定适合你的第一次训练和训练计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The active plan is set. The week schedule will appear here as soon as the latest plan snapshot finishes syncing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
