          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前计划已设置。最新计划同步完成后，每周安排会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The activity suggestion is linked to an active plan. The full plan will appear here as soon as the latest plan state finishes loading.": {
      "localizations": {
